# Eval harness lives in its own repository, cloned into evals/ for local
# development (see CLAUDE.md / README.md). It is not part of the published
# plugin, so the whole directory is ignored here.
evals/

# Generated at push-time by kaggle_runner/orchestrate.py's push() -- not
# hand-edited, not the source of truth (that's the KERNEL_SCRIPT_TEMPLATE
# in orchestrate.py). kaggle_runner/runs/ (pulled real-run evidence) is
# NOT ignored -- that's committed deliberately, matching the project's
# existing precedent of committing env/manipulation_check_output/.
kaggle_runner/kernel_template.py
kaggle_runner/kernel_template.ipynb
